  "title": "Smoked Rabbit",
  "description": "Rabbit meat has the tendency to get dry when smoked so you'll want to plan ahead and not skip the brining process. First bite in and you'll see that it was worth the wait.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
